<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GroupSend - Support</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .header p {
            font-size: 20px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }
        
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .section h2 {
            color: #667eea;
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #667eea;
        }
        
        .section p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #555;
        }
        
        .contact-info {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
        }
        
        .contact-info a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        
        .contact-info a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .footer {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .nav-links {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        
        .nav-links a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0 15px;
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .nav-links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>GroupSend</h1>
            <p>Effortless group messaging</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="section">
                <h2>About GroupSend</h2>
                <p>GroupSend makes it easy to send messages to multiple contacts at once. Whether you're organizing an event, sending updates to a team, or staying in touch with friends and family, GroupSend simplifies group communication.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Support</h2>
                <p>Need help with GroupSend? We're here to assist you!</p>
                <div class="contact-info">
                    <p><strong>Email Support:</strong></p>
                    <p><a href="mailto:phvzed@gmail.com">phvzed@gmail.com</a></p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><strong>Developer:</strong> PHZVED, LLC</p>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-top: 20px;">We typically respond to support inquiries within 24-48 hours.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <p><strong>Q: How do I create a group?</strong><br>
                A: Open GroupSend, tap the "+" button, and select contacts to add to your group.</p>
                
                <p><strong>Q: Is my data secure?</strong><br>
                A: Yes, we take privacy seriously. Read our <a href="https://russbuild.github.io/GroupSend-App/privacy-policy.html" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>
                
                <p><strong>Q: How do I cancel my subscription?</strong><br>
                A: You can manage your subscription through your iPhone Settings > [Your Name] > Subscriptions.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="https://russbuild.github.io/GroupSend-App/privacy-policy.html" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2025 PHZVED, LLC. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
